  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/BAAE67">Proposition <span data-tag="BAAE67">4.1.2.13</span>.</a> The collection of smooth maps $p: X \rightarrow S$ is stable under filtered colimits in $(\sSet )_{/S}$. </p>
</article>
